    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Working with the finicky dead for so long has given you a knack for speaking to them.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Membership with the Frozen Graves, ability to cast 3rd level spells</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You gain a +4 on the DC for spells that allow you to talk to the dead, such as call spirit, speak with dead, and speak with haunt.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc117\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
